  directions:
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Why can\u2019t I stop this company? Am I too weak? Is my surfing not
      good enough? I don't know how to fight a shark!"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I don't even know what they're building! I'm wasting my time\u2026
      I should just call it quits."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Your surfing is good\u2026"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Huh?
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "You jus\u2019 need a little more style\u2026"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: What? Who are you?
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Try and do some tricks\u2026 if you jump off the top of the wave and
      hold space all the way down, you can do a kickflip or a handstand. "
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: What the hell are you talking about?!
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Once you\u2019ve got style, the truth will be revealed."
